<h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #333;">{{ product.title }}</h2>
<p>RetroSound® Premium Stereo Speakers are 3-way speakers are built with three separate drivers for a broader frequency response. Having a dedicated driver for highs, mids, and lows, allows each frequency range to be reproduced more accurately and with greater clarity. For high-power handling with an ultra-thin mounting depth, a Neodymium magnet structure is used with a dip-cut design to prevent distortion. The Santoprene® surrounds provide the most accurate audio reproduction possible, and the silk tweeters produce smooth and more natural-sounding highs.</p>
<ul>
<li>4x8-inch stereo speakers (sold as a pair)</li>
<li>3-Way frequency response</li>
<li>Neodymium magnet structure for ultra-thin design</li>
<li>Santoprene® surrounds for accurate audio reproduction</li>
<li>Silk tweeters produce smooth and natural highs</li>
<li>Dip-cut magnet for enhanced sound</li>
<li>TrueRating™ power handling: 60 watts RMS/120 watts MAX power</li>
<li>Mounting depth just 1.59-inches (40.5mm)</li>
</ul>
